WEBVTT

00:09:30.211 --> 00:09:32.528
And the universe rewards us

00:09:32.552 --> 00:09:36.480
by showing us how incredibly
interesting and surprising it is.

00:09:37.171 --> 00:09:40.547
The future is fundamentally uncertain,

00:09:40.571 --> 00:09:43.750
and to me, that is certainly exciting.

00:09:44.344 --> 00:09:45.495
Thank you.

00:09:45.519 --> 00:09:51.626
(Applause)